      "writtenOn": "2022-06-17T01:09:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I renamed this to MakeGPUDeviceContext (it deviates from the existing MakeGrContext for WebGL but I think that\u0027s fine). I renamed the other functions to match this pattern (coming in the next patch set):\n\n* MakeGPUDeviceContext: Creates a GrDirectContext associated with a WebGPU device.\n* MakeGPUCanvasContext: Creates a WebGPU canvas context (i.e. swapchain) associated with a canvas.\n* MakeGPUTextureSurface: Creates a Surface for which the render target is a WebGPU texture.\n* MakeGPUCanvasSurface: Equivalent to  MakeGPUTextureSurface where the texture is the next swapchain texture in a GPUCanvasContext.\n* MakeWebGPUCanvasSurface: A helper that is equivalent to calling all of the above where the input is a HTMLCanvasElement and an optional GrDirectContext argument.",
      "parentUuid": "aa4eec8a_582d57dc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 269,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 269,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "e32b06a12ee23fed4598c5701b724d1699c66d6f",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
